---
name: release sentinel wave9
description: Trimmed Wave 8 temporal workflow fixture kept for bundle regression; deontic obligation tests use inline mer in Wave9NorthStarFixtureTests.
triggers:
  - "run release sentinel wave9"
parameters: service
---

Definition: a service is stale if the deploy step has ever failed.
Definition: a service is recoverable if the service is stale since the last deploy step succeeded.

To run release sentinel wave9 for a service:
  if the deploy step has ever failed,
    complete with reason "release sentinel saw a prior deploy failure".
  if the deploy step has failed within the last 7 days,
    complete with reason "release sentinel saw a recent deploy failure".
  if the service is recoverable,
    complete with reason "release sentinel is healthy since the last successful deploy".
  if it is unknown whether,
    complete with reason "release sentinel has no successful deploy anchor yet".
  otherwise,
    complete with reason "release sentinel is not healthy since the last successful deploy".
  complete with reason "release sentinel wave9 pass complete".
